      "title": "kafka: Use XXH32 from the xxHash library if we have it",
      "message": "kafka: Use XXH32 from the xxHash library if we have it\n\nThe initial implementation of Kafka LZ4 compression incorrectly\nincluded the LZ4 frame magic bytes in the checksum calculation.\nTo work around this, there's an implementation of XXH32 in the\ndissector. Use the version from the library (which is probably\nbetter optimized) if we have it, as we're checking for it now.\n",
